        {
            "_id": "gnpUtPxORZFL3ge0",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
            "name": "Endless Suffering",
            "sort": 400000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The type of torture that killed a tormented determines the effect of their Tortured Gaze. The damage type listed in parentheses deactivates their regeneration and is their damage weakness.</p>\n<p><strong>Lost in a Maze</strong> (mental) The tormented lost themselves in the confusing depths of the Ghostfang Coils. For 1 minute, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1}.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [
                    {
                        "key": "Weakness",
                        "type": "mental",
                        "value": 10
                    }
                ],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": []
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "7ExB5NXG4gI6NaQ4",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
            "name": "Tortured Gaze",
            "sort": 500000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>30 feet, or 60 feet if the tormented is at 125 HP or lower.</p>\n<p>The psychic agony of a tormented spills into the world around them, creating murderous hallucinations replicating the tormented's last moments. A non-undead creature that ends its turn in the aura must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:32|options:area-effect] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} for 1 minute. While it has a condition from Tortured Gaze, a creature can't gain a new condition from the aura.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [
                    {
                        "key": "Aura",
                        "radius": "ternary(gt(@actor.system.attributes.hp.value,125),30,60)",
                        "traits": [
                            "divine",
                            "illusion",
                            "mental"
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
                        "aura",
                        "divine",
                        "illusion",
                        "mental"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
