        {
            "_id": "dTghrpVy5Fq43qGt",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
            "name": "Scream in Agony",
            "sort": 700000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Each creature in the tormented's Tortured Gaze aura takes @Damage[14d6[mental]|options:area-effect,inflicts:sickened] damage (@Check[will|dc:34|basic] save). A creature that fails is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure). The tormented can't Scream in Agony again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Scream in Agony]]{1d4 rounds} but recharges the ability whenever they take damage from an attacker's critical hit or their own critical failure on a saving throw.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
